      <h2>Make the next campaign a better-informed decision.</h2>
    </div>
    <div>
      <p>Posting more or increasing ad spend can hide a deeper problem: the wrong offer, a message that misses the need, or a landing page that loses interested visitors.</p>
      <ul class="check-list">
        <li>Engagement looks healthy, but the business impact is unclear.</li>
        <li>Campaigns generate leads without a consistent way to assess their quality.</li>
        <li>You need a practical system for testing content, creative, or audiences.</li>
        <li>You want to understand how social supports the wider customer journey.</li>
      </ul>
