<section class="section">
  <div class="container">
    <p class="eyebrow">The work</p>
    <h2>Connect the message with what happens next.</h2>
    <div class="cards">
      <article class="card">
        <h3>Diagnose channel performance</h3>
        <p>Review the role of each channel, the audience you reach, campaign objectives, tracking, and the quality of the actions that follow.</p>
      </article>
      <article class="card">
        <h3>Build a focused test plan</h3>
        <p>Choose a specific customer need and a testable hypothesis. Define the message, creative angle, audience, and success measure before launching.</p>
      </article>
      <article class="card">
        <h3>Align the landing experience</h3>
        <p>Check that the page or contact journey follows through on the campaign promise, with a clear offer and an appropriate next action.</p>
      </article>
      <article class="card">
        <h3>Review and refine</h3>
        <p>Compare results with the agreed goal and reporting limitations. Use findings to decide what to keep, change, pause, or test next.</p>
      </article>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

